## 📌 Project Overview

This end-to-end data analytics project analyzes 10,000 credit card transactions to identify fraud patterns, engineer risk features, detect anomalies using statistical methods, and deliver actionable compliance insights — mirroring real-world financial operations analytics.

The project demonstrates the full analyst workflow: data quality checks → EDA → feature engineering → statistical hypothesis testing → anomaly detection → dashboard reporting.

---

## 🎯 Business Objective

> Identify high-risk transaction patterns, quantify fraud exposure by segment, and build a composite risk scoring model to support compliance monitoring and operations management decision-making.

